// # Byzantine Fault Tolerance (BFT) & Chained Consensus Facade
//
// Logline: Unified standard library facade re-exporting PBFT, HotStuff, Tendermint, DAG-BFT, Threshold Signatures, and Validator Staking engines.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim importing all 49 BFT consensus companion submodules.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import PBFT, HotStuff, Tendermint, DAG-BFT, Cryptography, Staking, Mempool, and Sync submodules.
//   2. Re-export typed public constructors and execution facade helpers.
//   3. Maintain unified standard library entry point for distributed Byzantine consensus subsystems.

